 and eating them. \n\nUpgrade and get better gear such as faster brooms, bigger and more efficient cauldrons and equip hook attachments to be able to carry more children. \n\nImprove your witch by increasing stats such as strength, health and stamina.\n\nLearn the strength and weakness of different type of children to better plan out the optimal strategy to make the biggest meat feast. \n\nCook and eat as many children as you can and compete with other players on the Meat Board, but watch out for the angry Daddies or they will hunt you down!","aboutGame":"In Cooking Witch you play as a witch flying to a party in the woods, abducting the children and cooking and eating them. \n\nUpgrade and get better gear such as faster brooms, bigger and more efficient cauldrons and equip hook attachments to be able to carry more children. \n\nImprove your witch by increasing stats such as strength, health and stamina.\n\nLearn the strength and weakness of different type of children to better plan out the optimal strategy to make the biggest meat feast. \n\nCook and eat as many children as you can and compete with other players on the Meat Board, but watch out for the angry Daddies or they will hunt you down!"},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/514580/header.jpg?t=1778786511"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/514580/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778786511"},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/514580/extras/255aef08e44d9e8a75534e5f000e4b27.avif?t=1778786511","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/514580/extras/968857c0ad8236ae7ec07f025dce74c9.avif?t=1778786511","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://share